Reads <file> with the strict loader of the relay proxy: version 2 required, unknown keys, bad references and
bad values are errors that name the file, the path of the key and the line. Secret references are checked for their
shape, not resolved. Exit code 0 when valid, 2 when invalid, 1 on another failure.

Usage:
  semaphore-cli config validate <file> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help[=true|false]   help for validate

Global Flags:
  -o, --output string   output format: text or json (YAML for print) (default "text")
